READ ME:

MIXCOP - Implementation of a model to assess the time-dependent effects of mixed pesticides on a collembolan population


R Code to execute the MIXCOP model (does not include the population model)

This model requires four additional CSV files:
    - File "MIXCOP_Main_data" contains all information relevant for the simulation.
    - File "MIXCOP_Compound" provides physicochemical data on the applied pesticides.
    - File "MIXCOP_Crop_data" includes details about the cultivated crops and their BBCH growth stages.
    - File "Climatetab" includes temperature data for the chosen Scenario

In addition, toxicity data files are required for all substances included.

Related publication:
Sybertz, A., R. Ottermanns, and M. Roß-Nickoll, MIXCOP - Implementation of a model to assess 
the time-dependent effects of mixed pesticides on a collembolan population. MethodsX, 2025: 
p. 103403, DOI: https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mex.2025.103403.
